r-field/choices "6fab64ec-672d-5cad-b805-6b8c20e17d4e"] [:db/add "730cceb4-aac2-54ca-9324-8d8a826b6eeb" :answer-field/choices "d39e89b5-6a59-59f1-b81b-a53d49cbe481"] [:db/add "730cceb4-aac2-54ca-9324-8d8a826b6eeb" :answer-field/choices "8f31ace5-52d8-5394-8aac-5d23d3bf5063"] [:db/add "730cceb4-aac2-54ca-9324-8d8a826b6eeb" :answer-field/choices "b315654d-48b4-5f3f-959d-9fc787763e59"] [:db/add "730cceb4-aac2-54ca-9324-8d8a826b6eeb" :answer-field/choices "7e41e84b-4da5-5051-8395-f0816c71edc7"] [:db/add "730cceb4-aac2-54ca-9324-8d8a826b6eeb" :answer-field/correct "7e41e84b-4da5-5051-8395-f0816c71edc7"] [:db/ensure "730cceb4-aac2-54ca-9324-8d8a826b6eeb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d" :question/id #uuid "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d"] [:db/add "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d" :question/problem "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(48^\\circ\\right)\\tan\\left(24^\\circ\\right)}{\\left(1-\\cos\\left(24^\\circ\\right)\\right)}\n$$"] [:db/add "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d" :question/worked-solution "Write $s=\\sin\\left(24^\\circ\\right)$ and $c=\\cos\\left(24^\\circ\\right)$. The **double-angle formula** gives $\\sin\\left(48^\\circ\\right)=2sc$.\n\n Also, $\\tan\\left(24^\\circ\\right)=\\frac{s}{c}$.\n\nRewrite the quotient ratio and cancel. Use $s^2+c^2=1$, factor the difference of squares, then cancel the matching binomial.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{2sc\\frac{s}{c}}{(1-c)} &=\\frac{2s^2}{(1-c)} \\\\ &=2\\frac{1-c^2}{(1-c)} \\\\ &=2\\frac{(1-c)(1+c)}{(1-c)} \\\\ &=2(1+c) \\\\ &=2\\left(1+\\cos\\left(24^\\circ\\right)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll cancellations use nonzero factors in the original expression."] [:db/add "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d" :question/answer-fields "730cceb4-aac2-54ca-9324-8d8a826b6eeb"] [:db/ensure "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186